<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>

<%- include('partials/header') %>

<main class="content-page">
  <section class="content-hero">
    <p class="content-eyebrow">Terms and Conditions</p>
    <h1>Simple rules for using Foodie Heaven services responsibly.</h1>
    <p class="content-lead">
      By browsing, ordering, or using any of our features, you agree to the following terms.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="policy-list">
    <article class="policy-card">
      <h2>Account Responsibility</h2>
      <p>You are responsible for keeping your login credentials secure and for activity on your account.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="policy-card">
      <h2>Order and Pricing</h2>
      <p>Prices may change without prior notice. Final payable amount is shown at checkout before confirmation.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="policy-card">
      <h2>Delivery and Cancellations</h2>
      <p>Delivery timelines are estimates. Cancellation/refund eligibility depends on order stage and partner policy.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="policy-card">
      <h2>Prohibited Use</h2>
      <p>Fraud, abusive behavior, fake orders, or misuse of offers can lead to temporary or permanent suspension.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="policy-card">
      <h2>Content and IP</h2>
      <p>All logos, branding, and platform content are protected and must not be copied or redistributed without permission.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="policy-card">
      <h2>Policy Updates</h2>
      <p>These terms may be updated periodically. Continued usage after updates means acceptance of revised terms.</p>
    </article>
  </section>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>

</body>
</html>
